screenshot results
click_ui repo_search_result
wait_for_refresh
wait_frames 20
workspace_checkpoint 3 deleted
screenshot deleted
click_ui full_file_back
wait_for_refresh
wait_frames 20
workspace_checkpoint 3 returned
screenshot returned
bench_frames 120
expect_p99_below 20
